{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/d6a41c24a6b755f033f3049abb090e73.avif?t=1765061410\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Student, Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are thrilled to inform you that you have been accepted into Cubiversity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 15 charming classmates, and join the prestigious Crafting Club, a cozy place to sew together something special!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/3cc7bfc05d2ea934363b6aa37b1c0558.poster.avif?t=1765061410\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/3cc7bfc05d2ea934363b6aa37b1c0558.webm?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/3cc7bfc05d2ea934363b6aa37b1c0558.mp4?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/d2bbb70d31eca8fadceea8c15289ad51.avif?t=1765061410\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance by elimination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 5 students for your project group, and end up with your soulmate at the end of the week!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/fae04ab559505051a5be1462fc2ce3e9.poster.avif?t=1765061410\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/fae04ab559505051a5be1462fc2ce3e9.webm?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/fae04ab559505051a5be1462fc2ce3e9.mp4?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-based approach</strong><br>Use your week to craft something with your partner, and unlock new characters at the end of each run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/2e64cced976c9d84356edded6e33c360.poster.avif?t=1765061410\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/2e64cced976c9d84356edded6e33c360.webm?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/2e64cced976c9d84356edded6e33c360.mp4?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dialogue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular dialogue based on the group you pick, the locations you go to, and many other variables, makes sure no two runs  are ever the same!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/ae3e80ba2465b7d217f493201998405a.poster.avif?t=1765061410\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/ae3e80ba2465b7d217f493201998405a.webm?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/ae3e80ba2465b7d217f493201998405a.mp4?t=1765061410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make leads to one of 30 endings! But no 3 a.m. breakdowns over a single wrong dialogue option, we promise!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inclusive and heartfelt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love comes in many forms, and Love Craft makes room for all of them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691640/extras/a3f376ba8886f374f0a2256a0fc57fa3.avif?t=1765061410\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We look forward to having you join us next week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours sincerely, <br>Jean, President of the Crafting Club \ud83d\udc8b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate fonts for better legibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-read dialogue any time with the history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skipping for any text you've already read</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Explosive Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691640/45e5059bba279f75dd661b69a16b84b1e2596e9e.jpg"},{"name":"CHRISSYYYYY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691640/5f5d353ab259119d9d6512e44a88cb67d3d04604.jpg"},{"name":"We ballin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691640/f8d7b3c3be7dceabb6ee5bb4594df1812839fe80.jpg"},{"name":"This is not a drill","path"